WEBVTT

00:54.679 --> 01:00.269
QUARANTINE ZONE, SLOW DOWN

01:25.961 --> 01:27.337
What's this?

01:27.837 --> 01:30.257
Gonna bury all the hogs again?

01:30.882 --> 01:32.842
It's not foot-and-mouth disease.

01:32.926 --> 01:36.638
There was a tiny leak
at the biotech district.

01:36.721 --> 01:40.309
-It's nothing.
-You said that before!

01:41.643 --> 01:46.481
If you bury my livestock again,
I'll really go mad!

01:48.483 --> 01:51.861
Don't worry. Go right ahead.

01:52.779 --> 01:55.240
Go on. Bye.

02:00.620 --> 02:02.706
Tiny leak on my hairy ass.

02:04.291 --> 02:06.293
They're so full of shit.

02:12.216 --> 02:14.343
Oh, boy!

02:26.521 --> 02:28.523
What the…

02:37.616 --> 02:40.285
Such a shitty day!

03:35.507 --> 03:40.554
Sir, if we pull out now,
the market will suffer.

03:41.055 --> 03:45.017
We don't know the real cause yet,
and this could be based on a false report…

03:47.394 --> 03:49.063
Yes, right away.

03:50.855 --> 03:51.690
Pardon?

03:52.399 --> 03:56.570
No, not at all. I'm still a novice.

03:57.654 --> 04:00.574
Okay, I'll see you for tee off.

04:01.450 --> 04:03.160
Yes, take care.

04:20.135 --> 04:21.386
Send Kim in.

04:25.432 --> 04:30.020
MYSTERIOUS FISH DEATH
AT JINYANG RESERVOIR

04:38.737 --> 04:42.032
-What should we do?
-Sell all related funds.

04:42.616 --> 04:44.576
-Everything?
-Yeah.

04:45.160 --> 04:47.204
There will be serious repercussions.

04:47.704 --> 04:51.208
Market stability
and individual traders will--

04:51.291 --> 04:53.335
-Kim.
-Yes, sir.

04:54.503 --> 04:56.380
Do you work for the lemmings?

04:58.673 --> 05:00.300
Sell everything right away.

05:01.969 --> 05:02.802
Yes, sir.

05:05.389 --> 05:06.640
Hey, Kim.

05:08.267 --> 05:09.101
Well...

05:09.726 --> 05:12.562
What do kids like nowadays?

05:18.402 --> 05:22.031
Let's not waste time suing each other.

05:22.656 --> 05:26.410
I don't care what you do
with your time. I'm raising Su-an.

05:27.036 --> 05:28.912
How can you raise her?

05:29.496 --> 05:31.165
Do you even talk to her?

05:32.499 --> 05:37.129
She wants to come here
tomorrow by herself! Did you know?

05:37.212 --> 05:38.713
Stop this bullshit!

05:40.132 --> 05:44.011
-You call yourself a father?
-She can't go there alone.

05:44.094 --> 05:47.639
Then bring her here. She wants to come.

05:48.307 --> 05:49.224
Not tomorrow.

05:49.849 --> 05:52.144
You know
her birthday is tomorrow, right?

05:52.644 --> 05:53.562
Of course!

06:21.923 --> 06:23.968
-Did you eat?
-Kind of.

06:24.676 --> 06:25.677
Where's Su-an?

06:26.928 --> 06:29.848
She's had her dinner. She's in her room.

06:31.725 --> 06:33.978
I can ride the train by myself.

06:35.104 --> 06:38.482
Why not?
You can come pick me up at the station!

06:43.195 --> 06:44.238
Mommy, I gotta go.

06:58.335 --> 06:59.962
It's okay, you can talk to her.

07:00.045 --> 07:00.879
I hung up.

07:04.758 --> 07:06.801
You told her you want to go to Busan?

07:08.678 --> 07:11.681
Sweetie,
I've been really busy with work lately.

07:13.433 --> 07:15.560
But I'll have some time next week.

07:15.644 --> 07:17.396
Could you wait till then?

07:26.446 --> 07:27.281
Here.

07:31.951 --> 07:34.621
Thought I'd forget? Happy birthday.

07:36.456 --> 07:37.582
Go on. Open it.

07:55.350 --> 07:57.769
What? You don't like it?

08:12.242 --> 08:13.868
From Children's Day this year.

08:18.082 --> 08:22.877
Is there anything else you want?

08:24.796 --> 08:29.884
Busan. I want to see Mommy. Tomorrow.

08:29.969 --> 08:34.348
I told you. Another time, okay?

08:34.431 --> 08:36.516
No, tomorrow.

08:37.226 --> 08:40.980
You make promises all the time,
but you never keep them.

08:42.522 --> 08:44.483
I won't waste your time.

08:45.067 --> 08:46.651
I can go alone.

08:54.284 --> 08:55.827
Are you busy nowadays?

08:56.620 --> 08:57.871
You know how it is.

08:59.248 --> 09:02.709
So you'll take her to Busan tomorrow?

09:03.710 --> 09:06.630
-Yes.
-That's good.

09:07.131 --> 09:10.175
While you're down there,

09:11.343 --> 09:17.432
have a heart-to-heart talk with Na-yeong.

09:18.892 --> 09:22.229
A marriage shouldn't be
broken off so easily.

09:24.648 --> 09:26.191
For Su-an's sake too.

09:26.275 --> 09:28.943
Mom, I'll take care of it.

09:32.364 --> 09:34.283
It's a crucial period right now.

09:36.576 --> 09:41.373
Sure, you know what's best.

09:43.292 --> 09:48.547
She was disappointed
that you weren't at the recital.

09:49.965 --> 09:53.677
It's a crucial period for her, too.

10:17.617 --> 10:24.624
Proudly swept the rain by the cliffs

10:25.750 --> 10:32.757
As it glided through the trees

10:33.633 --> 10:35.219
Still…

10:36.053 --> 10:37.304
It's fine.

10:38.973 --> 10:40.057
Baby, it's okay.

10:40.140 --> 10:42.559
-Su-an, go on.
-Let's cheer her with a clap!

10:57.992 --> 11:00.410
Yeah, Mom.

11:01.286 --> 11:02.454
Yeah.

11:03.122 --> 11:05.582
No, with Dad.

11:07.001 --> 11:11.713
Okay, bye. See you soon. Bye.

11:27.146 --> 11:30.482
I saw you sing at the school recital.

11:31.275 --> 11:34.403
When did you see it?
You weren't even there.

11:35.904 --> 11:39.533
I may look like I'm not there,
but I'm always watching you.

11:41.451 --> 11:44.246
You didn't finish, right?

11:45.164 --> 11:46.081
Right.

11:47.541 --> 11:50.169
Why didn't you? You should've finished it.

11:51.503 --> 11:55.549
Whatever you do,
you must finish what you start.

11:56.216 --> 11:58.135
It's worse than not doing it.

12:09.104 --> 12:11.106
Oh, Jesus.

12:15.777 --> 12:17.821
What's going on this early?

12:25.412 --> 12:27.456
Are you okay? Were you startled?

12:28.748 --> 12:30.459
That startled me.

12:41.595 --> 12:43.763
I guess something happened over there.

12:57.694 --> 12:59.821
Attention, please.

12:59.904 --> 13:05.869
KTX 101 bound for Busan
is departing shortly.

13:05.952 --> 13:07.204
Passengers who purchased…

13:07.287 --> 13:10.415
-Where is Car 4?
-Car 4 is that way.

13:10.499 --> 13:11.625
Thank you.

13:11.708 --> 13:13.877
Attention, please.

13:14.461 --> 13:20.300
KTX 101 bound for Busan
is departing shortly.

13:20.384 --> 13:21.385
Passengers…

13:39.653 --> 13:40.737
-Hye-yeong, hey!
-Yes?

13:41.238 --> 13:43.573
Your scarf. Adjust it, please.

13:49.871 --> 13:53.000
Everyone be quiet and sit down.

13:53.083 --> 13:54.334
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

13:57.046 --> 13:58.213
Look, it's Jin-hui!

13:58.297 --> 13:59.589
What? No way.

14:01.133 --> 14:05.554
-Hey, what are you doing here?
-I'm your team's cheer captain now.

14:05.637 --> 14:07.347
-You serious?
-Didn't you hear?

14:07.847 --> 14:09.641
-That's awesome!
-You got your wish.

14:10.225 --> 14:11.185
-Wanna sit?
-Good luck!

14:11.268 --> 14:12.769
-Okay.
-Okay.

14:13.728 --> 14:15.147
Hey, Jin-hui.

14:17.983 --> 14:19.151
Listening to something?

14:21.736 --> 14:25.991
-Go sit somewhere else.
-It's not even on.

14:26.075 --> 14:28.202
When I say I like you,

14:28.285 --> 14:32.539
just say "thank you,"
and accept your fate.

14:32.622 --> 14:35.875
-That's right.
-It's fate.

14:35.960 --> 14:42.007
-Accept her!
-Accept her!

14:46.303 --> 14:47.471
Jong-gil, here.

14:48.388 --> 14:50.599
When did you boil this?

14:50.682 --> 14:53.227
We'll arrive in an hour. What's the point?

14:53.310 --> 14:54.353
I don't want it.

14:54.436 --> 14:56.230
-Take it.
-No way.

14:57.189 --> 15:00.067
-Here's some salt.
-Mr. Seo, are you on the train?

15:00.150 --> 15:01.318
Yes, what is it?

15:01.818 --> 15:03.737
We've been getting a lot of calls.

15:03.820 --> 15:06.490
There was a strike
at Ansan industrial park.

15:07.199 --> 15:08.033
Yeah?

15:09.576 --> 15:13.998
Prepare a situation report for me
when you get to work.

15:14.081 --> 15:16.333
-I think I'll be back before lunch.
-Yes, sir.

16:20.355 --> 16:24.985
I'm sorry.

16:25.069 --> 16:28.113
I'm so sorry.

16:28.613 --> 16:30.657
I'm really sorry.

16:40.917 --> 16:42.461
-Excuse me?
-Yes?

16:43.753 --> 16:45.339
-Good morning.
-Good morning.

16:45.839 --> 16:48.717
-I think an odd person came on board.
-Where?

16:49.218 --> 16:52.054
-There's someone in the bathroom.
-I see.

16:52.554 --> 16:54.639
I think something's not right.

16:54.723 --> 16:56.433
-It's been a while.
-Yes.

16:56.516 --> 16:59.519
Our apologies. I'll check right away.

16:59.603 --> 17:00.562
All right.

17:11.031 --> 17:11.991
Excuse me?

17:14.659 --> 17:15.577
Hello?

17:19.206 --> 17:20.165
Sir?

17:27.797 --> 17:30.009
All dead. Everyone…

17:30.968 --> 17:33.971
Sir? Excuse me?

17:34.804 --> 17:36.890
May I check your ticket?

17:38.058 --> 17:39.268
All dead.

17:39.768 --> 17:42.271
Sir, if you do not have a ticket,

17:42.354 --> 17:45.357
you'll be escorted off
at the next station.

17:46.775 --> 17:48.110
Everyone's dead.

17:50.029 --> 17:51.530
-Everyone's dead.
-Pardon?

17:53.073 --> 17:55.159
All dead.

17:59.371 --> 18:00.539
Hey, kiddo.

18:01.123 --> 18:03.083
If you don't study,
you'll end up like him.

18:03.167 --> 18:04.584
Sir, please come out.

18:04.668 --> 18:08.505
Mom said
whoever says that is a bad person.

18:08.588 --> 18:09.756
Please come out.

18:09.839 --> 18:12.676
She must've flunked school.

18:12.759 --> 18:14.594
Sir, you can't stay here.

18:15.345 --> 18:17.681
Please come out. Let's move to the back.

18:53.383 --> 18:54.218
Urgent?

18:56.136 --> 18:58.305
Two people are peeing. It'll take a while.

18:58.388 --> 19:02.017
There, use that one over there. Go on.

19:05.437 --> 19:07.022
It will take a while.

19:07.856 --> 19:10.525
Honey, how's it going in there?

19:11.818 --> 19:14.821
I'm sorry. No worries.

19:14.904 --> 19:17.491
Take your time. Go over there.

19:19.451 --> 19:22.037
Take it easy. She's gone.

19:22.121 --> 19:22.997
Relax.

19:32.131 --> 19:34.258
Miss, are you okay?

19:34.841 --> 19:36.969
Miss! Oh, no.

19:38.303 --> 19:40.930
Reporting medical emergency in Car 11.

19:41.015 --> 19:42.099
Chief?

19:55.988 --> 19:57.489
-Hello?
-Yes, Kim?

19:57.572 --> 20:00.159
It's more serious than I thought.

20:00.242 --> 20:02.494
It wasn't just Ansan.

20:02.577 --> 20:06.999
I don't know what's happening,
but it's not a simple strike.

20:07.082 --> 20:09.293
They say it's nationwide.

20:09.376 --> 20:10.835
-What about breathing?
-Hello?

20:10.919 --> 20:12.004
Is she breathing?

20:12.087 --> 20:13.922
-Yes, she is.
-Hello?

20:14.006 --> 20:16.341
But her seizure is uncontrollable!

20:16.425 --> 20:18.177
Sir, what should we do?

20:18.260 --> 20:19.636
I'll call you back.

20:28.853 --> 20:30.647
INDISCRIMINATE VIOLENCE AT RIOT

20:30.730 --> 20:33.442
Oh no. They'll get hurt.

20:33.525 --> 20:34.943
That's terrible.

20:35.027 --> 20:38.197
People nowadays
will riot over just about anything.

20:38.280 --> 20:41.033
In the old days, they'd be re-educated.

20:41.116 --> 20:42.909
You mustn't say that.

20:44.661 --> 20:45.745
Oh my. Look.

20:47.414 --> 20:49.833
-What's up with them?
-My goodness.

20:49.916 --> 20:50.917
Miss?

20:53.212 --> 20:54.088
What do I do?

20:57.757 --> 21:00.135
Chief? Where are you?

21:03.222 --> 21:04.431
I don't believe this.

21:14.524 --> 21:15.359
Chief?

21:31.375 --> 21:33.127
Min-ji? Hello?

21:55.357 --> 21:58.193
-What is that?
-What's going on?

22:03.115 --> 22:04.283
What is it?

22:08.078 --> 22:09.079
What's happening?

22:11.540 --> 22:12.541
Holy shit!

22:23.802 --> 22:26.721
One moment, please!

22:49.828 --> 22:52.497
Hurry! Everyone, run!

22:56.335 --> 23:01.381
We've got a situation!
Sir, violence broke out in the cabin!

23:14.186 --> 23:15.229
Run!

23:35.915 --> 23:37.834
-Oh, my God!
-What the hell?

23:49.179 --> 23:50.764
Get away! Just go!

23:57.229 --> 23:59.982
Get out of here! Head towards the back!

24:00.065 --> 24:01.483
Get up! Hurry!

24:23.755 --> 24:25.299
Daddy!

25:00.875 --> 25:01.918
Run!

25:02.586 --> 25:03.420
Hurry!

25:06.840 --> 25:07.924
Baby?

25:09.634 --> 25:12.179
Sang-hwa, you're so damn loud.

25:12.262 --> 25:13.847
Sorry, the thing is--

25:14.348 --> 25:16.058
Get off of me!

25:26.986 --> 25:29.113
You idiot, go help her!

25:31.615 --> 25:33.658
Hey! What's with you?

25:37.371 --> 25:38.455
What's with you?

25:54.179 --> 25:56.765
Baby? Seong-gyeong!

25:59.476 --> 26:00.810
You can run, right?

26:18.078 --> 26:20.664
MASSIVE VIOLENCE
CASUALTIES MOUNTING

26:21.165 --> 26:23.250
Run! Everyone, hurry!

26:33.760 --> 26:35.512
Get the door!

26:37.056 --> 26:38.223
Shut the door!

26:39.641 --> 26:41.143
Quick!

26:41.851 --> 26:43.020
Shut it!

26:44.438 --> 26:45.730
Shut it now!

26:46.231 --> 26:47.274
Quick!

26:47.357 --> 26:49.276
Just shut it!

26:56.575 --> 26:57.617
I know him!

27:04.666 --> 27:06.210
Hurry!

27:10.839 --> 27:12.466
How do I lock this thing?

27:13.717 --> 27:15.344
Hey, do you know how?

27:16.178 --> 27:17.012
Huh?

27:17.762 --> 27:19.264
Do you hear me?

27:23.185 --> 27:24.269
Let it go.

27:25.187 --> 27:26.021
What?

27:29.191 --> 27:31.151
I don't think they know how to open it.

27:41.536 --> 27:43.038
They attack because they see us.

28:03.225 --> 28:05.935
What in the…

28:06.020 --> 28:07.479
What the hell are they?

28:11.525 --> 28:12.817
Su-an, are you okay?

28:14.486 --> 28:15.320
Hey, buddy.

28:16.946 --> 28:17.822
What is it?

28:19.783 --> 28:21.326
Don't you owe me an apology?

28:21.910 --> 28:23.203
What do you mean?

28:23.287 --> 28:28.083
Look at this chump.
You shut the door in our faces, asshole!

28:28.167 --> 28:31.253
Watch what you're saying.
You weren't the only ones in danger!

28:32.587 --> 28:34.089
What a piece of work.

28:34.839 --> 28:37.801
Come here. I will throw you out.

28:37.884 --> 28:40.470
Stop it! Everyone's just scared.

28:45.767 --> 28:47.352
Attention, please!

28:47.436 --> 28:53.483
Due to our current situation,
we won't be stopping in Cheonan.

28:53.567 --> 28:57.321
For your safety,
please stay in your seats.

28:58.572 --> 28:59.739
Excuse me.

28:59.823 --> 29:00.824
What's going on?

29:02.451 --> 29:04.203
Hello? Anyone there?

29:05.037 --> 29:06.538
Yes, go ahead!

29:06.621 --> 29:10.542
Do you even know
what's going on back here?

29:10.625 --> 29:12.419
Why aren't you stopping in Cheonan?

29:12.502 --> 29:13.795
We're aware, sir.

29:13.878 --> 29:17.299
I've just evacuated as well.
But it's an order from our control center.

29:17.382 --> 29:18.508
Please be seated.

29:18.592 --> 29:23.263
That's nonsense! People are going rabid!

29:23.763 --> 29:25.724
Stop in Cheonan, got it?

29:27.434 --> 29:28.393
Excuse me.

29:32.481 --> 29:35.317
I'm really sorry,
but do you think she could sit down?

29:35.400 --> 29:36.943
-She's pregnant.
-Stop it.

29:37.027 --> 29:38.570
-Okay.
-Take a seat.

29:38.653 --> 29:40.572
-I'm fine.
-Thank you.

29:40.655 --> 29:41.991
MOM

29:43.742 --> 29:44.618
Mom?

29:44.701 --> 29:48.205
Are you on your way?

29:49.248 --> 29:50.832
Yes, we're en route.

29:51.833 --> 29:53.877
Where are you and why is it so loud?

29:53.961 --> 29:57.506
What's happening? Everyone's fighting.

29:58.423 --> 30:02.094
Are you and Su-an okay?

30:02.177 --> 30:04.596
You are breathing hard. Are you hurt?

30:06.056 --> 30:08.933
Seok-u, my baby!

30:09.018 --> 30:13.438
Please take care of Su-an.

30:14.231 --> 30:15.440
Mom, you okay?

30:16.733 --> 30:19.236
My dear Su-an…

30:22.697 --> 30:28.537
I love her so much,
but she only wants her mom.

30:31.290 --> 30:32.916
You bastards!

30:41.008 --> 30:41.967
Mom?

30:44.553 --> 30:45.554
Dad.

30:48.057 --> 30:49.141
Dad!

30:51.310 --> 30:53.312
Is Grandma okay?

31:01.111 --> 31:03.947
-What the hell?
-What is it?

31:04.698 --> 31:06.325
Sweetie, let's sit down.

31:20.505 --> 31:21.673
Open the door!

31:51.203 --> 31:52.912
My fellow citizens.

31:53.788 --> 31:58.043
We're currently experiencing
violent riots in all major cities

31:58.127 --> 32:00.337
including seoul,

32:00.420 --> 32:05.259
resulting in many civilian
and police injuries.

32:05.968 --> 32:10.430
Riots have led
to the shutting down of various districts,

32:10.514 --> 32:15.310
and some rioters have destroyed
police buses, or climbed the roofs

32:15.394 --> 32:17.687
in an attempt to hijack them.

32:17.771 --> 32:19.189
Good job.

32:19.898 --> 32:23.193
For this reason,
we're entering a state of emergency

32:23.943 --> 32:30.117
in order to keep our citizens safe
and control the current situation.

32:32.702 --> 32:35.955
Thanks to our government's rapid response,

32:36.040 --> 32:38.417
the number of riots are decreasing.

32:38.500 --> 32:39.334
Be quiet!

32:39.418 --> 32:42.796
The situation will be resolved soon.

32:44.006 --> 32:45.340
Fellow citizens,

32:45.966 --> 32:52.139
please refrain
from reacting to baseless rumors

32:52.222 --> 32:58.062
and stay in the safety of your homes.

32:58.145 --> 33:01.356
We must stay calm and trust the government

33:01.440 --> 33:04.568
in order to overcome
such trying obstacles.

33:05.652 --> 33:09.448
We believe
that your safety is not in jeopardy.

33:23.045 --> 33:24.504
ANALYST KIM

33:24.588 --> 33:26.340
CASUALTIES INCREASE
NOT JUST A PROTEST

33:31.261 --> 33:33.347
Mommy's phone is off.

33:37.309 --> 33:40.270
Those in the front, hurry up!

33:40.770 --> 33:42.147
Su-an, sit over here.

33:42.939 --> 33:45.192
Don't worry. I'll give her a call.

33:45.275 --> 33:47.152
My goodness.

33:47.236 --> 33:51.448
-Come sit over here.
-You're older. You sit down.

33:51.531 --> 33:52.532
I'm fine. Take it.

33:52.616 --> 33:53.950
Baby, let's go over there.

33:58.538 --> 34:01.375
Ma'am, take my seat.

34:01.458 --> 34:04.628
-I'm okay.
-No, please sit.

34:08.423 --> 34:11.343
Child, would you like one?

34:12.636 --> 34:14.054
Hurry and go.

34:14.138 --> 34:15.847
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

34:15.930 --> 34:17.641
What a great kid.

34:22.521 --> 34:24.398
-We both got seats.
-Keep walking.

34:25.649 --> 34:26.775
That bag…

34:28.693 --> 34:30.988
Su-an, you didn't have to do that.

34:31.571 --> 34:32.531
Do what?

34:33.032 --> 34:34.033
Being nice.

34:34.533 --> 34:37.202
At a time like this,
only watch out for yourself.

34:40.539 --> 34:41.456
Answer me.

34:46.711 --> 34:49.423
Grandma always had knee aches.

34:51.675 --> 34:52.509
Sweetie.

34:57.764 --> 35:01.018
May I have your attention?
We apologize for the inconvenience.

35:01.560 --> 35:05.022
Our train will conclude
service at Daejeon station.

35:05.772 --> 35:11.278
Military is deployed there,
and will secure our train,

35:11.361 --> 35:15.282
so every passenger
must exit once we arrive.

35:15.365 --> 35:20.287
I repeat.
Daejeon station is our last stop.

35:20.370 --> 35:22.706
Which cities can be entered?

35:22.789 --> 35:25.459
Yeosu, Uljin, Busan. What about Daejeon?

35:25.542 --> 35:27.586
Excuse me. Let me use the bathroom.

35:27.669 --> 35:29.463
What about Daejeon?

35:29.546 --> 35:30.797
Why not?

35:32.591 --> 35:35.177
Sweetie, stay here for a moment.

35:39.139 --> 35:41.350
-Hey, kiddo.
-Yes?

35:41.933 --> 35:43.477
Who is he? Your dad?

35:44.478 --> 35:45.312
Yes.

35:45.395 --> 35:46.981
-Real dad?
-Yes.

35:47.939 --> 35:49.358
It just seems strange.

35:50.359 --> 35:51.401
What does he do?

35:51.485 --> 35:53.862
He's a fund manager.

35:53.945 --> 35:56.448
-Fund manager?
-Yes.

35:57.116 --> 35:58.658
He's a bloodsucker.

35:59.909 --> 36:01.661
He leaches off others.

36:01.745 --> 36:04.956
Don't say that in front of his child.

36:05.040 --> 36:09.586
It's okay. That's what everyone thinks.

36:15.634 --> 36:16.593
Want some?

36:17.927 --> 36:19.429
It's what Sleepy eats.

36:21.056 --> 36:23.433
This is Sleepy. Say hello.

36:24.851 --> 36:27.271
Your baby's name is Sleepy?

36:27.354 --> 36:31.191
No, the fetus name. It's like a nickname.

36:31.275 --> 36:35.612
Her dad is too lazy
to come up with a name yet.

36:37.697 --> 36:39.783
-Touch her belly.
-Right here.

36:41.493 --> 36:42.411
Go on.

36:48.250 --> 36:49.084
Felt it?

36:50.877 --> 36:52.504
I made that.

36:56.383 --> 36:58.552
-You idiot.
-But it's true, no?

37:00.054 --> 37:01.305
LEMMINGS

37:04.058 --> 37:05.100
DAEJEON LT. MIN

37:11.731 --> 37:14.693
Mr. Seo, you called me at a bad time.

37:14.776 --> 37:15.944
Wait!

37:16.028 --> 37:18.780
-Let me ask you something.
-What?

37:20.407 --> 37:21.992
I'm on the KTX to Daejeon.

37:22.076 --> 37:26.496
KTX? You mean the KTX?

37:26.580 --> 37:27.747
So, you heard?

37:28.790 --> 37:32.002
Is it true that the military
is deployed in Daejeon?

37:32.919 --> 37:34.338
Yes, that's correct.

37:35.672 --> 37:39.051
Is that so? It must be safe there.

37:41.136 --> 37:43.263
Well, it's…

37:44.974 --> 37:48.018
Min, it's safe, right?

37:48.935 --> 37:52.647
Once you arrive, you'll be quarantined.

37:53.148 --> 37:54.649
-I'm sorry.
-What?

37:58.612 --> 38:00.489
I'm with my daughter.

38:02.074 --> 38:05.327
Can you help me and my daughter?

38:07.246 --> 38:10.624
-But the thing is--
-I'll get you a real scoop.

38:10.707 --> 38:11.750
Come on, please.

38:13.877 --> 38:18.048
Don't go to the main square.
Come to the east one.

38:18.132 --> 38:19.924
I'll let my men know.

38:20.009 --> 38:23.053
Okay. Thank you so much.

38:31.020 --> 38:32.187
All dead.

38:36.608 --> 38:37.817
All dead.

38:48.912 --> 38:50.747
-What's going on?
-Are they not here?

38:50.830 --> 38:52.624
-So quiet.
-Is this Daejeon?

39:00.590 --> 39:01.591
There's nobody.

39:02.342 --> 39:03.385
No one here?

39:21.445 --> 39:22.362
Excuse me.

40:13.288 --> 40:14.956
What's going on back there?

40:18.085 --> 40:21.630
This is that violent incident
I told you about.

40:21.713 --> 40:22.714
Conductor!

40:22.797 --> 40:24.633
-Conductor?
-Yes.

40:25.550 --> 40:29.596
How many can fit in the engine car?
We must uncouple it and go to Busan.

40:29.679 --> 40:30.514
-Uncouple?
-Yes!

40:30.597 --> 40:32.224
-We can't.
-Why not?

40:32.307 --> 40:33.767
We can't do it here.

40:35.352 --> 40:37.687
Where's the military?

40:37.771 --> 40:41.233
Right. I only received a report about it.

40:41.316 --> 40:43.068
Where's my business card?

40:43.777 --> 40:48.991
I'm COO of Stallion Express.
All routes into Daejeon are cut off.

40:49.074 --> 40:51.994
-Our buses are all rerouted.
-What do you mean?

40:52.077 --> 40:54.496
The city's been blockaded!

40:54.579 --> 40:56.456
They probably won't let us in.

40:56.540 --> 41:01.211
But South Shore is still open,
so let's go to Busan!

41:01.295 --> 41:03.838
Wait, if that's true,

41:03.922 --> 41:05.757
we must take others.

41:05.840 --> 41:07.176
-Take who?
-I mean...

41:07.259 --> 41:09.719
-Let's check the station first.
-Hey!

41:13.098 --> 41:13.932
Damn it!

41:36.580 --> 41:39.291
RESTRICTED AREA

41:53.055 --> 41:55.015
RESTRICTED

41:57.101 --> 41:58.393
Don't mind them.

42:04.733 --> 42:06.776
-Come on, sweetie.
-Where are we going?

42:08.112 --> 42:09.446
We're going this way.

42:09.529 --> 42:10.739
Just us?

42:11.323 --> 42:12.532
Yes, let's go.

42:18.788 --> 42:19.623
What is it?

42:22.126 --> 42:23.502
I'm going that way.

42:24.211 --> 42:27.256
Main square is that way.
Just follow other people.

42:27.339 --> 42:28.590
I'm coming with you.

42:29.758 --> 42:34.263
I heard you on the phone earlier.
About pulling you two out.

42:36.265 --> 42:38.475
I know the others will be quarantined.

42:40.644 --> 42:41.811
It's not true, Su-an.

42:41.895 --> 42:43.563
-We're just...
-I'll tell the others.

42:43.647 --> 42:47.276
-You don't have to.
-Of course I do!

42:47.359 --> 42:49.736
Forget them!
Everyone is for themselves!

42:51.405 --> 42:55.034
You only care about yourself.

42:57.536 --> 43:01.206
That's why Mommy left.

43:20.225 --> 43:21.060
Sweetie.

43:25.397 --> 43:27.774
Here! Over here!

43:27.857 --> 43:29.776
Please help!

43:29.859 --> 43:33.322
-Sweetie, stay right here.
-Please help!

43:52.216 --> 43:54.009
Damn it. What's happening? Hold on!

43:55.927 --> 43:57.012
Hold on!

44:08.565 --> 44:10.275
Go back up! Go!

44:12.152 --> 44:13.237
Help!

44:13.320 --> 44:14.321
-What the...
-Hurry!

44:28.335 --> 44:29.669
-Lt. Min!
-Mr. Seo!

44:29.753 --> 44:30.670
I'm in Daejeon.

44:30.754 --> 44:33.215
My men over there, I can't contact them!

44:33.298 --> 44:34.174
What?

44:34.674 --> 44:35.925
Hello?

44:36.010 --> 44:37.094
Help me.

44:39.929 --> 44:40.847
Please--

44:55.070 --> 44:56.696
Su-an!

45:12.004 --> 45:13.005
Come on, hurry!

45:18.510 --> 45:21.721
-Come on! Hurry!
-Hurry!

45:33.442 --> 45:35.319
Hurry up! Quick!

45:36.236 --> 45:37.112
Block it!

45:55.547 --> 45:56.590
Run! Come on!

46:01.928 --> 46:03.222
Asshole! Come on!

46:11.563 --> 46:12.731
Faster!

46:15.317 --> 46:16.401
Hold them off!

46:49.977 --> 46:54.064
-Over here! Run!
-This way! Hurry!

46:54.148 --> 46:55.524
-Come on!
-Here!

46:56.900 --> 46:58.986
-Hurry!
-Here!

46:59.069 --> 47:00.988
-This way!
-Hurry!

47:01.071 --> 47:02.697
Come on!

47:02.781 --> 47:03.865
-Hurry!
-This way!

47:03.948 --> 47:08.412
-Why aren't we leaving yet?
-There are still more people!

47:08.495 --> 47:09.997
-Hurry up!
-Here!

47:10.080 --> 47:12.291
-Hurry!
-Come this way!

47:12.374 --> 47:14.960
-Hurry!
-Hurry!

47:15.044 --> 47:16.503
-Faster! Here!
-This way!

47:30.059 --> 47:33.353
Ma'am! Please get up!

47:41.945 --> 47:44.323
-No, stop!
-No!

47:44.406 --> 47:46.866
-My sister!
-Hurry!

47:52.956 --> 47:55.334
-Hop on!
-Hurry!

48:15.354 --> 48:16.188
Me too!

48:16.981 --> 48:21.068
Let me in! Please!

48:38.793 --> 48:41.338
How much longer? We have to leave!

48:41.421 --> 48:43.590
-No! My friends aren't here yet!
-Hey!

48:44.591 --> 48:46.593
Those on board must survive!

48:47.094 --> 48:49.179
Aren't I right?

48:54.934 --> 48:59.356
Conductor, please depart.

49:19.668 --> 49:21.170
Run! Let's go!

49:37.269 --> 49:39.813
Look, the train! Run faster!

49:59.499 --> 50:00.750
Snap out of it, idiot!

50:30.155 --> 50:30.990
Watch out!

50:52.927 --> 50:57.432
Control. Train 101 could not dock
at Daejeon due to an outbreak.

50:57.516 --> 51:00.602
Advise which station
is available to dock, over.

51:00.685 --> 51:05.899
Train 101. Due to unstable communications,
it is difficult to advise.

51:05.983 --> 51:11.030
Control. Is Train 101 clear
to reach Busan? Over.

51:13.991 --> 51:18.370
Train 101, we'll clear
your route to Busan. Control center, out.

51:19.871 --> 51:22.416
Advise when you make contact with Busan.

51:23.417 --> 51:24.584
Train 101, out.

52:40.285 --> 52:42.997
Attention, everyone.

52:43.080 --> 52:48.460
For the safety of those on board,
we won't be making any stops,

52:48.543 --> 52:50.587
and will head straight for Busan.

52:51.921 --> 52:55.842
-Conductor, can you hear me?
-Go ahead.

52:56.426 --> 52:58.137
Were you able to contact Busan?

52:58.220 --> 53:01.515
No, the communication is erratic.

53:01.598 --> 53:04.476
Full speed, no matter what!

53:05.185 --> 53:07.104
Or we won't get in, understand?

53:14.861 --> 53:16.655
Yeong-guk, where are you?

53:17.281 --> 53:18.115
Damn it.

53:19.241 --> 53:22.202
I thought you were dead!

53:22.286 --> 53:23.662
I'm sorry.

53:26.123 --> 53:30.252
No one else made it. I'm sorry.

53:40.345 --> 53:41.638
The number you have dialed--

53:41.721 --> 53:43.974
-Baby?
-Mister!

53:45.017 --> 53:47.602
Why are you answering? Where are you?

53:47.686 --> 53:52.899
-We're in the train washroom!
-Washroom? Which car?

53:52.983 --> 53:55.569
Well, it's…

53:55.652 --> 53:56.987
Car 13!

53:57.071 --> 53:59.073
-Get your ass over here right now!
-Baby!

54:02.742 --> 54:04.828
Was that my kid? Is she okay?

54:05.454 --> 54:06.997
They're in the washroom in Car 13.

54:22.262 --> 54:23.222
Gonna pass through?

54:25.557 --> 54:29.686
Let's say you make it and rescue them.
How will you come back?

54:34.149 --> 54:35.317
In Car 15,

54:37.194 --> 54:38.528
people are gathered there.

55:03.803 --> 55:05.805
Only four cars away.

55:07.807 --> 55:08.808
I'll lead.

55:10.602 --> 55:11.520
You in the middle.

55:13.272 --> 55:14.273
And you in the back.

55:17.776 --> 55:19.736
Block anyone attacking from the rear.

55:31.831 --> 55:33.917
I heard you're a fund manager.

55:37.087 --> 55:41.841
Then you're an expert
at leaving useless people behind.

55:48.848 --> 55:50.225
Wait till we exit the tunnel.

56:05.449 --> 56:06.283
Let's go.

57:17.980 --> 57:19.564
Come on!

57:21.525 --> 57:22.484
Let's go!

57:39.459 --> 57:40.294
Out of the way.

59:15.847 --> 59:16.848
Run!

59:23.981 --> 59:24.856
Move over.

59:28.986 --> 59:32.739
They stopped
once we entered the tunnel, right?

59:33.615 --> 59:37.244
-Probably because it got dark.
-Yeah, I think so too.

59:39.997 --> 59:41.623
There are even more here.

59:43.292 --> 59:44.334
What do we do now?

59:45.877 --> 59:47.212
We have no choice.

59:48.088 --> 59:48.922
Let's go.

59:53.052 --> 59:54.678
-What?
-Give me your phone.

01:01:28.022 --> 01:01:28.855
Are you okay?

01:01:59.553 --> 01:02:00.929
Get that out of my face.

01:02:03.765 --> 01:02:04.766
Yo, douche.

01:02:06.101 --> 01:02:09.938
Felt good to see your kid, thanks to me?

01:02:10.022 --> 01:02:12.482
Are you grateful or what?

01:02:12.566 --> 01:02:14.818
Why is your ringtone so tacky?

01:02:16.153 --> 01:02:18.072
What's wrong with it?

01:02:19.739 --> 01:02:22.117
How do I change it?

01:02:23.202 --> 01:02:27.414
Am I funny? You little rat.

01:02:28.498 --> 01:02:30.875
-How tall are you?
-I'm 181 cm.

01:02:31.710 --> 01:02:34.713
Ten kilometers away,
at 300 kilometers an hour…

01:02:34.796 --> 01:02:35.630
What?

01:02:39.009 --> 01:02:39.926
Two minutes.

01:02:40.010 --> 01:02:42.262
The upcoming tunnel
will give us two minutes.

01:02:42.346 --> 01:02:45.182
-Can we do it?
-We gotta.

01:02:45.807 --> 01:02:50.020
If we miss this one,
there's another in three kilometers.

01:02:50.104 --> 01:02:54.191
I bet you never get to play
with your daughter.

01:02:56.110 --> 01:02:57.777
When she gets older,

01:02:59.196 --> 01:03:02.074
she'll understand why you work so hard.

01:03:04.326 --> 01:03:07.454
Dads get all the bad rap and no praise.

01:03:08.247 --> 01:03:10.165
But it's all about sacrifice, right?

01:03:13.961 --> 01:03:17.089
What's with the look? Did I sound cool?

01:03:17.672 --> 01:03:18.507
Yeah?

01:03:25.973 --> 01:03:27.474
PEOPLE RESCUED, HEADING OVER NOW

01:03:29.184 --> 01:03:32.896
-My friend's coming here!
-What? What did you say?

01:03:32.980 --> 01:03:36.566
My friend from another car is coming over.

01:03:36.650 --> 01:03:38.818
-Who's coming?
-My friend.

01:03:38.902 --> 01:03:40.570
He was in Car 9.

01:03:40.654 --> 01:03:42.614
He rescued some people,
and they're headed here.

01:03:42.697 --> 01:03:43.615
Rescued?

01:03:45.617 --> 01:03:50.164
From there to here,
passing through those monsters?

01:03:51.331 --> 01:03:52.582
Without any injuries?

01:03:54.293 --> 01:03:55.794
You sure they're not infected?

01:03:57.129 --> 01:04:00.049
Are you damn sure?

01:04:01.341 --> 01:04:03.093
What do you mean?

01:04:03.177 --> 01:04:05.929
Hey. Look at these people.

01:04:06.555 --> 01:04:08.265
At this moment,

01:04:08.348 --> 01:04:11.060
there are so many people here
who don't know

01:04:11.143 --> 01:04:12.978
what happened to their families.

01:04:13.937 --> 01:04:18.483
We don't even know
if your damn friends are infected!

01:04:19.068 --> 01:04:21.486
And you want to let them in here?

01:04:25.991 --> 01:04:27.159
I don't believe this.

01:04:37.252 --> 01:04:38.462
Sir,

01:04:41.006 --> 01:04:43.258
please say something.

01:04:44.093 --> 01:04:45.885
They'll be here soon.

01:04:48.263 --> 01:04:49.556
Sir!

01:04:50.640 --> 01:04:51.641
Sir.

01:08:37.659 --> 01:08:39.036
Get over here!

01:08:47.752 --> 01:08:48.712
One.

01:08:51.423 --> 01:08:52.424
Two.

01:08:58.847 --> 01:08:59.806
Run!

01:09:03.352 --> 01:09:04.269
Come on!

01:09:10.484 --> 01:09:11.360
Hey!

01:09:13.403 --> 01:09:15.489
Jin-hui!

01:09:18.075 --> 01:09:19.618
Hurry the hell up!

01:09:29.794 --> 01:09:33.840
Open up! Hey, open this door!

01:09:35.634 --> 01:09:39.554
-Open the door!
-Open this door!

01:09:40.430 --> 01:09:41.515
Open this door!

01:09:42.099 --> 01:09:42.975
Jin-hui!

01:09:52.442 --> 01:09:53.318
Open the door!

01:09:53.902 --> 01:09:57.406
-Open up!
-Jin-hui!

01:10:07.666 --> 01:10:09.126
Open it now!

01:10:09.626 --> 01:10:12.462
It won't budge! I can't open it!

01:10:12.546 --> 01:10:14.173
Smash it!

01:10:14.756 --> 01:10:15.674
Stand back.

01:10:22.514 --> 01:10:23.723
Hurry up!

01:10:26.560 --> 01:10:28.853
Damn it.

01:10:53.712 --> 01:10:55.297
You stupid idiots!

01:11:08.268 --> 01:11:09.979
Damn it! Come on!

01:11:21.781 --> 01:11:23.033
In-gil.

01:11:27.871 --> 01:11:29.206
Yeong-guk!

01:11:31.541 --> 01:11:33.043
Stand back!

01:11:33.835 --> 01:11:35.004
Yeong-guk!

01:12:10.080 --> 01:12:11.123
Stay away!

01:12:18.047 --> 01:12:21.883
Stay back, baby. Please go!

01:12:28.307 --> 01:12:29.849
Buddy, hey!

01:12:30.517 --> 01:12:33.353
Take her and leave.

01:12:34.479 --> 01:12:36.065
You have to go.

01:12:37.316 --> 01:12:39.068
I said go, douche!

01:12:40.860 --> 01:12:42.737
I'm getting tired. Please go.

01:12:46.783 --> 01:12:50.579
Take care of her, okay?

01:12:51.080 --> 01:12:55.000
I'll hold them off. Just go!

01:13:05.427 --> 01:13:07.304
I'm sorry.

01:13:18.107 --> 01:13:19.941
We have to go. Let's go!

01:13:22.069 --> 01:13:23.278
Yun Seo-yeon!

01:13:25.822 --> 01:13:27.532
That's our baby's name!

01:13:28.783 --> 01:13:29.618
Got it?

01:15:30.239 --> 01:15:31.573
Why did you do it?

01:15:33.783 --> 01:15:35.160
You bastard!

01:15:37.204 --> 01:15:38.622
We could've saved them!

01:15:41.083 --> 01:15:41.958
Why?

01:15:43.543 --> 01:15:45.045
He's infected!

01:15:46.421 --> 01:15:48.340
He's one of them!

01:15:49.008 --> 01:15:50.509
This guy is infected!

01:15:50.592 --> 01:15:52.677
His eyes! Look at his eyes!

01:15:52.761 --> 01:15:55.472
He'll become one of them!

01:15:55.555 --> 01:15:56.974
Do you all want to die?

01:15:57.057 --> 01:15:58.350
We must throw them out!

01:16:03.230 --> 01:16:04.314
Hey!

01:16:09.528 --> 01:16:12.072
Those of you who just arrived,

01:16:13.323 --> 01:16:15.993
I don't think you can stay with us.

01:16:17.911 --> 01:16:19.538
Please move to the vestibule.

01:16:34.761 --> 01:16:35.679
Just go!

01:16:39.016 --> 01:16:40.767
-Get out!
-Hurry up and leave!

01:16:40.850 --> 01:16:42.186
Leave now!

01:16:48.483 --> 01:16:49.484
Get out now!

01:16:51.403 --> 01:16:52.571
Hurry up!

01:16:53.780 --> 01:16:54.781
Move!

01:16:57.367 --> 01:17:00.745
-Go!
-Leave us!

01:17:00.829 --> 01:17:02.664
-Get the hell out!
-Hurry!

01:17:04.624 --> 01:17:05.917
Out now!

01:17:07.752 --> 01:17:09.796
-Hurry!
-Get out now!

01:17:09.879 --> 01:17:12.299
-Come on!
-Hurry!

01:17:12.382 --> 01:17:15.302
It'll be safer for you to stay here.

01:17:15.385 --> 01:17:18.430
No. This place is scarier.

01:17:19.806 --> 01:17:21.058
I'm coming with you.

01:17:21.141 --> 01:17:22.017
But…

01:17:22.101 --> 01:17:23.560
Get the hell out!

01:17:24.103 --> 01:17:26.188
What are you waiting for?

01:17:26.730 --> 01:17:27.939
Okay, let's go.

01:17:30.692 --> 01:17:33.195
Get out, the rest of you!

01:17:33.695 --> 01:17:35.114
Get out!

01:17:35.197 --> 01:17:37.116
Get out of here!

01:17:55.092 --> 01:17:56.010
Let's go.

01:18:32.671 --> 01:18:35.049
-Tie it faster!
-Tie it there, too!

01:18:35.132 --> 01:18:37.092
-Hurry!
-More ties! Neckties!

01:18:37.176 --> 01:18:39.219
Shut up! I'm working on it!

01:18:55.569 --> 01:18:58.947
You idiot. Good riddance.

01:19:00.365 --> 01:19:04.078
Always helping others instead of yourself.

01:19:08.707 --> 01:19:10.750
Why did you lead such a difficult life

01:19:12.211 --> 01:19:14.588
if you were going to end up like this?

01:19:15.922 --> 01:19:17.257
So stupid.

01:19:24.514 --> 01:19:25.975
Shut up! Be quiet!

01:19:27.226 --> 01:19:28.477
Stay in your seat!

01:19:29.728 --> 01:19:32.022
What a load of shit.

01:19:36.943 --> 01:19:39.071
Finish up and do the other side too.

01:19:49.999 --> 01:19:53.877
Thank you for everything.

01:19:55.337 --> 01:19:58.215
That bitch. Stop her!

01:20:52.352 --> 01:20:55.147
Control! This is Busan-bound Train 101!

01:20:55.230 --> 01:20:57.149
Requesting current status report, over!

01:20:58.442 --> 01:21:01.070
Control? Control!

01:22:27.990 --> 01:22:29.616
It's your birthday today.

01:22:34.246 --> 01:22:35.330
Don't worry.

01:22:36.123 --> 01:22:38.000
I'll take you to Mom, no matter what.

01:22:42.129 --> 01:22:43.964
Aren't you scared?

01:22:50.012 --> 01:22:51.055
Of course I am.

01:22:53.307 --> 01:22:54.474
I'm scared too.

01:22:59.229 --> 01:23:01.356
I was so scared earlier.

01:23:02.066 --> 01:23:05.069
I thought I'd never see you again.

01:23:07.279 --> 01:23:11.992
I practiced that song just for you.

01:23:16.455 --> 01:23:18.290
That's why I couldn't finish.

01:23:21.001 --> 01:23:22.627
Because you weren't there.

01:23:30.385 --> 01:23:32.596
Will you stay with me from now on?

01:23:46.901 --> 01:23:50.739
NA-YEONG

01:24:00.540 --> 01:24:06.088
The person you're calling
is not available.

01:24:15.430 --> 01:24:19.726
ANALYST KIM

01:24:21.686 --> 01:24:22.687
Yes, Kim.

01:24:24.564 --> 01:24:26.275
Have you arrived at Busan yet?

01:24:26.358 --> 01:24:29.153
Not yet, where are you?
Are you okay there?

01:24:30.904 --> 01:24:33.615
I heard they succeeded
in defending Busan at an early stage.

01:24:33.698 --> 01:24:36.326
What? You sure?

01:24:36.910 --> 01:24:38.453
Where did you get that info?

01:24:39.329 --> 01:24:43.500
Sir, I heard
that all of this started at YS Biotech.

01:24:46.086 --> 01:24:50.215
The very same company
we saved with our scheme!

01:24:54.636 --> 01:24:55.554
Sir.

01:24:56.388 --> 01:24:59.391
This has nothing to do with us, right?

01:25:00.600 --> 01:25:03.478
We only do what we are told to.

01:25:03.562 --> 01:25:07.232
This is not my fault, right?

01:25:10.569 --> 01:25:11.528
Kim,

01:25:12.821 --> 01:25:14.156
it's not your fault.

01:25:18.160 --> 01:25:19.244
Thank you.

01:25:21.538 --> 01:25:22.456
Kim…

01:26:44.954 --> 01:26:51.962
DONGDAEGU STATION

01:27:07.686 --> 01:27:09.438
Attention, please.

01:27:09.521 --> 01:27:13.942
Due to a blockage on our track,

01:27:14.026 --> 01:27:16.486
we have stopped at Dongdaegu Station.

01:27:16.570 --> 01:27:20.324
We should either wait for the rescue team,

01:27:20.407 --> 01:27:25.245
or we'll have to reach
Busan in another train.

01:27:25.787 --> 01:27:28.040
As soon as I end this announcement,

01:27:28.123 --> 01:27:33.628
I will find a working train
and put it on the leftmost track.

01:27:33.712 --> 01:27:37.174
-What's he saying?
-I repeat, leftmost track.

01:27:37.257 --> 01:27:42.221
If you're alive, please transfer safely.

01:27:44.223 --> 01:27:45.349
Godspeed.

01:28:51.290 --> 01:28:53.292
Do you think they'll send a rescue team?

01:28:55.835 --> 01:28:57.879
I heard that Busan is safe.

01:29:00.424 --> 01:29:01.883
We have to move now.

01:29:25.615 --> 01:29:26.450
Here.

01:29:56.855 --> 01:29:57.939
What the…

01:30:46.989 --> 01:30:48.157
Is the coast clear?

01:30:51.326 --> 01:30:52.161
Yeah.

01:30:55.289 --> 01:30:56.331
You go first.

01:31:20.939 --> 01:31:22.691
We have to find a way across.

01:31:25.319 --> 01:31:26.153
Let's go.

01:31:28.280 --> 01:31:29.114
Let's go.

01:31:46.506 --> 01:31:47.716
What in the…

01:32:00.312 --> 01:32:01.188
Over here!

01:32:38.642 --> 01:32:40.769
-No.
-Oh no.

01:32:41.811 --> 01:32:44.648
-What now?
-Hey!

01:32:45.440 --> 01:32:47.567
We have to move, come on!

01:32:55.617 --> 01:32:57.119
Jin-hui, hurry!

01:33:13.593 --> 01:33:14.553
Stand back.

01:33:27.899 --> 01:33:28.858
Jin-hui!

01:33:43.207 --> 01:33:44.374
Jin-hui!

01:33:45.209 --> 01:33:46.085
Jin-hui.

01:33:56.053 --> 01:33:57.471
This can't be.

01:34:03.602 --> 01:34:04.644
I'm sorry.

01:34:27.542 --> 01:34:32.965
Daddy!

01:34:33.048 --> 01:34:37.719
Daddy! Wake up!

01:34:38.303 --> 01:34:42.557
Daddy!

01:34:43.850 --> 01:34:45.602
Daddy!

01:34:57.947 --> 01:34:59.616
What's going on?

01:35:03.537 --> 01:35:05.247
Come on, faster!

01:35:06.373 --> 01:35:07.416
Hurry!

01:35:13.130 --> 01:35:14.464
Damn it!

01:35:16.675 --> 01:35:18.677
Hurry!

01:35:30.939 --> 01:35:32.232
Help.

01:36:15.525 --> 01:36:16.693
Sweetie, come here!

01:36:21.656 --> 01:36:23.408
Su-an.

01:36:39.924 --> 01:36:40.759
Mister!

01:36:59.486 --> 01:37:00.320
Sweetie!

01:37:00.404 --> 01:37:02.364
Su-an, come here!

01:37:02.864 --> 01:37:03.907
Mister.

01:37:03.991 --> 01:37:06.410
Go! Hurry!

01:37:06.493 --> 01:37:07.452
Come on!

01:37:08.037 --> 01:37:08.870
Hurry!

01:37:10.247 --> 01:37:11.081
Quick!

01:37:31.351 --> 01:37:32.394
Let's go!

01:38:55.727 --> 01:38:57.021
Hurry!

01:39:00.607 --> 01:39:01.483
Daddy!

01:41:23.417 --> 01:41:24.418
Mister,

01:41:26.461 --> 01:41:27.546
I'm scared.

01:41:30.632 --> 01:41:32.717
Take me home.

01:41:32.801 --> 01:41:37.931
My mom is waiting for me.

01:41:41.643 --> 01:41:43.270
My address is

01:41:43.937 --> 01:41:48.025
Gwangan-dong, Suyeong-gu, Busan...

01:41:50.944 --> 01:41:53.238
Please help me!

01:41:56.575 --> 01:42:00.329
You are infected.

01:42:06.501 --> 01:42:07.419
No.

01:42:09.504 --> 01:42:10.339
No.

01:42:11.423 --> 01:42:12.257
No!

01:42:13.592 --> 01:42:18.722
I can't be! No!

01:42:31.110 --> 01:42:32.069
Daddy!

01:42:43.913 --> 01:42:45.165
Daddy!

01:43:17.572 --> 01:43:18.782
No!

01:43:24.913 --> 01:43:27.874
Daddy!

01:44:40.364 --> 01:44:43.867
Daddy!

01:44:43.950 --> 01:44:45.035
Su-an, come here.

01:44:45.535 --> 01:44:47.496
Sit down, over there.

01:44:48.080 --> 01:44:48.998
Seong-gyeong!

01:44:50.707 --> 01:44:52.209
Pay attention and listen to me.

01:44:53.293 --> 01:44:55.754
This must be the brake.

01:44:55.837 --> 01:45:00.175
When it's safe, pull on this. Got it?

01:45:06.556 --> 01:45:07.391
Sweetie.

01:45:09.601 --> 01:45:11.936
Look at me, Su-an. It's okay.

01:45:16.775 --> 01:45:18.943
Look at me, sweetie.

01:45:19.694 --> 01:45:21.905
Su-an, listen to me.

01:45:23.615 --> 01:45:27.119
Stay with her, no matter what. Okay?

01:45:28.287 --> 01:45:30.289
And what was it?

01:45:30.372 --> 01:45:31.873
It'll be safe in Busan.

01:45:32.499 --> 01:45:34.084
-So--
-Don't go!

01:45:35.210 --> 01:45:37.587
Don't go! It's all my fault.

01:45:38.797 --> 01:45:42.592
Daddy, don't go.

01:45:43.969 --> 01:45:45.345
Please.

01:45:47.722 --> 01:45:48.890
Don't.

01:45:50.850 --> 01:45:55.647
Stay with me. Don't go.

01:45:57.774 --> 01:45:59.151
Please!

01:46:01.153 --> 01:46:02.487
Don't go!

01:46:04.614 --> 01:46:06.700
Please don't go!

01:46:10.996 --> 01:46:13.373
Don't go! No!

01:46:16.585 --> 01:46:20.714
Daddy! Don't go!

01:46:20.797 --> 01:46:23.383
Daddy!

01:46:23.968 --> 01:46:28.973
Daddy! Don't go!

01:46:29.056 --> 01:46:34.394
Daddy!

01:51:24.559 --> 01:51:25.435
Look.

01:51:34.694 --> 01:51:37.114
Two bogeys approaching from the tunnel.

01:51:37.197 --> 01:51:39.449
Presumably a woman and a child, over.

01:51:41.618 --> 01:51:43.620
Check for infection, over.

01:51:47.041 --> 01:51:49.501
Where did you crawl out of?

01:51:54.423 --> 01:51:56.133
Unable to verify.

01:51:58.802 --> 01:52:02.306
Unable to verify
with the naked eye. Advise, over.

01:52:04.766 --> 01:52:05.892
Neutralize them, over.

01:52:26.580 --> 01:52:33.045
Proudly swept the rain by the cliffs

01:52:34.046 --> 01:52:40.635
As it glided through the trees

01:52:41.220 --> 01:52:47.977
Still following ever the bud

01:52:48.060 --> 01:52:54.816
The 'ahihi lehua of the vale

01:52:55.817 --> 01:52:58.070
Survivors approaching!

01:52:58.153 --> 01:53:04.159
Aloha 'oe

01:53:04.243 --> 01:53:10.749
We'll meet again when the flowers bloom

01:53:10.832 --> 01:53:14.294
Aloha 'oe

01:53:14.378 --> 01:53:18.048
Aloha 'oe

01:53:18.132 --> 01:53:24.096
Until we meet again
